he canonical digest of the admitted winning\n138|\t// Lease Record, never an envelope fingerprint.\n139|\twantLease, err := reader.winningLeaseFor(idA, \"direct\")\n140|\tif err != nil {\n141|\t\tt.Fatal(err)\n142|\t}\n143|\tif plan.LeaseRecordID != wantLease.Digest {\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
